<title>HONG KONG: Kookmin Bank to issue $100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Kookmin Bank to issue $100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kookmin Bank plans to issue a US$100 million floating rate note issue next week, arranger ABN AMRO Bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>The notes will carry a maturity of three years and will have put and call options at the end of the first year.</p>
<p>The notes will be launched bond-style at 40 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>There will be a fixed re-offer price.</p>
<p>Kookmin Bank is rated A3 by Moody's Investors Service and A-minus by Standard &amp; Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
